<title>UK: CSFB sets warrants on Sulzer shares.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets warrants on Sulzer shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Sulzer registered shares.</p>
<p>Twenty  warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    830 CHF		   PREMIUM	15.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.55 CHF		  GEARING	6.4 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.JAN.97-11.JAN.99   PAYDATE	24.JAN.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    20			  SPOT REF     836 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
